  <name>Pinba PHP Extension (PHP 8.5)</name>
  <summary>Timer and profiling extension for PHP 8.5</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Pinba measures PHP script execution and sends compact Protocol Buffers
      statistics over UDP to a Pinba server — the pinba_engine storage engine
      for MySQL or MariaDB — enabling real-time monitoring of request time,
      memory usage and user-defined timers.
    </p>
    <p>
      This package provides the extension built for PHP 8.5.
    </p>
  </description>

  <developer id="io.github.xolegator">
